      "content": "but it's not just about safety. i mean, what's the point of being \"safe\" if i have absolutely nothing left? my family, my reputation, all of it is just going to be destroyed by this. it feels like the only way to actually stop the shame and the pressure is to just... make it stop. does it even make sense to keep trying when the math just doesn't add up anymore?",
